+   "Warm the engine fully before riding hard. Low oil flow to the top end at low rpm is part of the cam wear story."
+  ]
+ },
+ "recalls": [],
+ "recallNote": "Any recalls on bikes this old were closed long ago.",
+ "known": [
+  {
+   "title": "Cam wear",
+   "what": "Early V4 engines wore cam lobes, rocker faces and cam bearings prematurely.",
+   "src": "https://www.math.uwaterloo.ca/~rblander/V4_cams.html"
+  }
+ ],
